  "ruleText": "Lsa 401.02 Renewal of License. Any licensee wishing to renew a license shall submit an application as specified in Plc 308.05.\n\nSource. #8861, eff 3-28-07; ss by #10679, eff 9-30-14; ss by #13850, eff 3-10-24; ss by #14170, eff 3-10-25",
